 as your ship engages in automated combat against AI opponents or other players, showcasing the power of your choices. With spectacular scale and dynamic encounters, each battle is a thrilling test of your skills as you climb the ranks and conquer the stars.",
    "short_description": "Spaceship Idle is an idle/incremental game that allows you to build your own modular spaceship and battle with other commanders. Explore the vast tech tree, unlock unique weapons, design your own spaceship layout, trade with global players, and win epic space (auto)battles!",
